Package: omarchy-ane-tools
Architecture: arm64
Depends: python3, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Apple Neural Engine userspace tools for the in-kernel ANE driver
 Userspace for the Apple Neural Engine driver in Aurora's kernel:
 omarchy-ane-run (with libane linked statically), omarchy-ane-smoke, which
 runs 20 add calls and reports one JSON result, and
 omarchy-ane-firmware-fetch, which installs this Mac's ANE firmware when its
 owner runs it. Members of the accel group get access to the device node.
 .
 The package installs no kernel module, device-tree overlay, firmware or
 model, and runs nothing at installation.
